      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Registers the given <a href=\"../RepositoryConfigurationExtension.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository.config\"><code>RepositoryConfigurationExtension</code></a> to indicate the repository configuration for a\nparticular store (expressed through the extension's concrete type) has happened.",
