      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Registers the discovered repositories in the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/support/BeanDefinitionRegistry.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.support\"><code>BeanDefinitionRegistry</code></a>.",
